From 7b243fdd7e160df71ccdf7e50768e21829826b81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 14:42:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 724/913] drivers: stm32mp_provisioning: do not call
 stm32_bsec_shadow_read_otp()

stm32_bsec_shadow_read_otp() takes about 37us to execute, and in the case
that we don't print debug trace this time is lost for no reason.

Move stm32_bsec_shadow_read_otp() under TRACE_LEVEL condition.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 04ff6fb6bf3e7edd335f5dfb59f44aaf08f77e5f drivers: stm32mp_provisioning: do not call stm32_bsec_shadow_read_otp()]
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I451bc5eb439925f671d08fdf7f9128aa13ff4a4e
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/534181
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/drivers/stm32mp_provisioning.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/drivers/stm32mp_provisioning.c b/core/drivers/stm32mp_provisioning.c
index 8586bbcdf..e25f234cb 100644
--- a/core/drivers/stm32mp_provisioning.c
+++ b/core/drivers/stm32mp_provisioning.c
@@ -97,9 +97,11 @@ static void provision(struct shadow_otp *shadow_otp, size_t index)
 		break;
 	}
 
+#if TRACE_LEVEL >= TRACE_DEBUG
 	if (stm32_bsec_shadow_read_otp(&otp_val, otp_id))
 		panic();
 	DMSG("Read SHADOW %#"PRIx32, otp_val);
+#endif
 }
 
 static void load_provisioning(void)
-- 
2.53.0

